{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13358","headline":"东峰亭各赋一物得岭上云 · 崔何","name":"东峰亭各赋一物得岭上云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伫立增远意，中峰见孤云。\n溶溶傍危石，片片宜夕曛。\n渐向羣木尽，残飞更氤氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}